/// previously started for this workflow execution, was successfully
/// canceled. TimerFired – A timer, previously started for this workflow
/// execution, fired. TimerStarted – A timer was started for the workflow
/// execution due to a StartTimer decision. WorkflowExecutionCancelRequested
/// – A request to cancel this workflow execution was made.
/// WorkflowExecutionCanceled – The workflow execution was successfully
/// canceled and closed. WorkflowExecutionCompleted – The workflow
/// execution was closed due to successful completion.
/// WorkflowExecutionContinuedAsNew – The workflow execution was closed
